## Interface: 16001
## Title: XanaBags
## Notes: Press R3 on an item in your bags or bank, or Alt+click it, to give it a colored border of your choice. Colored items, then quest items, are sorted to the front when the bags or bank open. /xbank lists what was in your bank at your last visit.
